### Gamma Shop API - walkthrough for IntelliJ's HTTP client (or copy into Postman)
### Run the app first, then execute these top to bottom.
### Replace PASTE_..._HERE values with data from previous responses.

### 1. Login as the demo customer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "customer@gammashop.local", "password": "Customer123!"}

### 2. Browse products (public, no token needed)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### 3. Add product 1 to the cart (paste accessToken from step 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_CUSTOMER_TOKEN_HERE

{"productId": 1, "quantity": 2}

### 4. Preview totals with the sample promotion
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/preview
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_CUSTOMER_TOKEN_HERE

{"promotionCode": "WELCOME10"}

### 5. Checkout -> note the order "id" in the response
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_CUSTOMER_TOKEN_HERE

{"promotionCode": "WELCOME10"}

### 6. Create a payment intent for the order -> note "intentId"
POST http://localhost:8080/api/payments/intent/1
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_CUSTOMER_TOKEN_HERE

### 7. Simulate a successful payment at the mock gateway (no token needed)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/mock-gateway/pay/PASTE_INTENT_ID_HERE/complete?outcome=success

### 8. Confirm the order is PAID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_CUSTOMER_TOKEN_HERE

### 9. Login as staff for the middle office
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "staff@gammashop.local", "password": "Staff123!"}

### 10. View orders waiting to be processed
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/orders/pending
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_STAFF_TOKEN_HERE

### 11. Move the order through fulfilment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_STAFF_TOKEN_HERE

{"status": "PROCESSING"}

### 12. Mark packed, then shipped, then completed
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/orders/1/packed
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_STAFF_TOKEN_HERE

### 13. Download the invoice PDF
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/orders/1/invoice
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_STAFF_TOKEN_HERE

### 14. Login as admin for reports
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "admin@gammashop.local", "password": "Admin123!"}

### 15. Daily sales report (also try format=csv or format=pdf)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/reports/sales/daily?start=2026-07-01&end=2026-07-31
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### 16. Order audit trail
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/audit/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### --- Guest flow ---

### 17. Create a guest session -> note "guestToken"
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/guest

### 18. Guest adds to cart (no login, only the header)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cart/items
Content-Type: application/json
X-Guest-Token: PASTE_GUEST_TOKEN_HERE

{"productId": 2, "quantity": 1}

### 19. Guest converts to a real account (cart is merged automatically)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/guest/convert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guestToken": "PASTE_GUEST_TOKEN_HERE",
  "email": "newuser@example.com",
  "password": "NewUser123!",
  "fullName": "New User"
}
